    {
      "text": "うたで　あいてを　こうげきする。\nみんなで　りんしょう　すると　つづけて\nだすことが　でき　いりょくも　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "노래로 상대를 공격한다.\n함께 돌림노래를 하면 계속해서\n쓸 수 있고 위력도 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用歌聲攻擊對手。\n大家一起輪唱便可以接連使出，\n威力也會提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur attaque l’ennemi en chantant.\nSi plusieurs Pokémon déclenchent cette attaque\nà la suite, l’effet augmente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Angriff mit Gesang. Singt der Anwender mit allen im\nKanon, steigt die Stärke.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un canto que ataca al objetivo. Cuantos más Pokémon\nlo usan, más aumenta de potencia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attacca il bersaglio con una melodia. Se usata\ndurante lo stesso turno da più Pokémon, i danni\ninflitti aumentano.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks the target with a song. Others can\njoin in the Round to increase the power of\nthe attack.",
